              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A crowd? (గుంపు, gumpu.) The world? (ప్రపంచం, prapañcaṁ.) An earthquake? (భూకంపం, bhūkampaṁ.) Dust? (దుమ్ము, dummu.) Smoke? (పొగ, poga.) Otherwise? (లేకపోతే, lēkapōtē.) Even so? (అయినా, ayinā.) Through? (ద్వారా, dvārā.) About? (గురించి, guriñci.) Without? (లేకుండా, lēkuṇḍā.) If by chance? (ఒకవేళ, okavēḷa.) Instead of? (బదులు, badulu.) According to? (ప్రకారం, prakāraṁ.) Actually? (అసలు, asalu.) Anyway? (ఏదేమైనా, ēdēmainā.) On purpose? (కావాలని, kāvālani.) By mistake? (పొరపాటున, porapāṭuna.) Never mind? (పోనీ, pōnī.) A condition? (షరతు, ṣaratu.) An excuse? (సాకు, sāku.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
